1
00:00:00,433 --> 00:00:02,173
(Amy:)We're never getting our drinks.

2
00:00:02,335 --> 00:00:04,045
(Bernadette:)No, but we knew that.

3
00:00:05,338 --> 00:00:06,938
(Penny:)Hey, can I start you off
with something to drink?

4
00:00:07,106 --> 00:00:09,346
(Lucy:)-Oh, water would be great.
-Okay.

5
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:13,350
(Penny:)You're Lucy, right?
I'm a friend of Raj Koothrappali's.

6
00:00:13,512 --> 00:00:14,962
(Penny:)Actually Amy recognized you.

7
00:00:22,955 --> 00:00:24,795
(Lucy:)Wow. How's he doing?

8
00:00:24,957 --> 00:00:26,367
(Penny:)Oh, you know, he's good.

9
00:00:26,525 --> 00:00:27,525
(Lucy:)Great.

10
00:00:27,693 --> 00:00:29,803
(Penny:)Yeah, this is none of my business.

11
00:00:29,962 --> 00:00:32,912
(Penny:)But why did you break up
with him in an e-mail?

12
00:00:33,799 --> 00:00:35,299
(Lucy:)Oh, I don't know.

13
00:00:35,468 --> 00:00:37,308
(Lucy:)I guess I thought it would be easier.

14
00:00:38,304 --> 00:00:40,304
(Penny:)Yeah, I get that.
I'll go get you your water.

15
00:00:43,209 --> 00:00:45,819
When you say "easier,"

16
00:00:45,978 --> 00:00:47,578
(Penny:)you mean easier for you, right?

17
00:00:47,747 --> 00:00:49,747
'Cause it certainly
didn't make it easier for him.

18
00:00:50,616 --> 00:00:53,996
(Lucy:)Any chance I can get
a different waitress?

19
00:00:54,153 --> 00:00:58,023
(Penny:)I'm sorry, this is rude of me.
I will get that water.

